---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../site';
---
<Base title={`Privacy | ${SITE.name}`} description="How SubFixer handles your files and data." path="/privacy/">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p class="lede">Your subtitle files are processed entirely in your browser. They are never uploaded, stored or seen by us.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>If we add analytics, they will be cookie-free and only count page views and which tools are used. We do not collect personal data or track you across sites.</p>
  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>The site loads Google's ad script, which may set cookies to serve and measure ads. No ad is shown on the site until Google approves it. The ad provider describes its cookies and your choices in its own policy. Where required, you will be asked for consent first.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:hello@subfixer.app">hello@subfixer.app</a></p>
</Base>
